        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. As California votes in the primary elections, who are the candidates? Americas Issued on: 03/06/2026 - 11:55 US primaries are taking place in six states. The voting will shape the landscape of the midterms in November, as it decides who is going to be on the ballot. Key races to look out for include California, where whoever wins the race for Los Angeles mayor will lead the city during the Olympic Games. Californian elections test for divided Democrats on pivotal primary election day 03/06/2026 Americas Pro-Trump candidate lead in Colombia 'part of Donroe doctrine' asserting itself in region 01/06/2026 Americas Centenary of Marilyn Monroe: 'Just as relevant now as she was then' 01/06/2026 Culture How to handle armed groups? Colombians vote in presidential election 31/05/2026 Americas \"Fujimori never again!\" Protesters fill streets of Lima ahead of Peru presidential elections 31/05/2026 Americas US says 'more than capable' of resuming war, as peace deal remains elusive 30/05/2026 Americas How to to end edemic violence in Colombia? Presidential elections to take place on Sunday 30/05/2026 Americas Bolivia at a 'breaking point'? Government blames fugitive ex-leader for unrest 30/05/2026 Americas Judge blocks Trump's Kennedy center plan and halts renovation plan 30/05/2026 Americas"
